{'symbol': 'BEN', 'date': '2022-12-19 09:00:00', 'title': 'FRANKLIN TEMPLETON LAUNCHES CLEARBRIDGE SUSTAINABLE INFRASTRUCTURE EXCHANGE-TRADED FUND', 'text': "SAN MATEO, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--FRANKLIN TEMPLETON TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF THE CLEARBRIDGE SUSTAINABLE INFRASTRUCTURE EXCHANGE-TRADED FUND (ETF), EXPANDING THE FIRM'S U.S.-BASED ETF OFFERINGS. USING THE TICKER SYMBOL INFR, THE FUND IS NOW LISTED ON NASDAQ. CLEARBRIDGE INVESTMENTS IS A SPECIALIST INVESTMENT MANAGER OF FRANKLIN TEMPLETON."}